# Cinderfall's vent pool with a heat suit (CIPlay cinderfall_acidsuit, 11-12 w09; in a test world 'CI ...').
# The suit box at the rim (cf_ventsuits, -32.4 -53.2) gives 180 s of suit; into the pool to the surveyors' locker and
# back out, unhurt, with the pool still there.
island Cinderfall keep
offset 0.9743 -0.0458
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
at -31.8 -52.4
use cf_ventsuits
expect shown cf_ventpool
walk -31.8 -52.4 to -34.5 -49.6 to -37 -48.8
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Surveyors' locker
wait 2
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
picture cf_vent_in -33.5 +2.2 -51.5 -38 +0.3 -48
walk -37 -48.8 to -34.5 -49.6 to -31.5 -52
expect unhurt
